The '''{{zone|Pale Citadel}}''' is an upcoming {{Skl|Combat}}-oriented island. Other than its name and planned release window, no features have been revealed: however, its gameplay is described as a 'raid'. It is intended to take full advantage of the latest Minecraft versions.

== Confirmed Features ==
* The '''Pale Citadel''' is described as a 'raid'.
* The '''Pale Citadel''' will have a reward system that directly rewards the player with {{c}}.
* The '''Pale Citadel''' will feature a 'queueing' system instead of using [[Party Finder]].
<blockquote>
For the Catacombs we currently don't have plans to change party finder.<br>However for Pale Citadel we are doing a queueing system instead of party finder. You are still able to queue into it with a party if you have one, but if you are alone the system is a lot more streamlined. The content is designed around the fact that you might be playing with totally random people.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/489529070913060867/1510991226487177216/1514642329494093955</ref>
</blockquote>

